#. <CLT 23>そのプレゼントは渡す事ができません。<CLT>
#. <CLT 3>“重要アイテム”<CLT><CLT 23>ですので…<CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Sorry, but we can't let you give her that. It's what\n"
"we in the industry like to call a<CLT> <CLT 3>key item<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>渡すプレゼントを選択してくださいませ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>What would you like to give her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …いいの？
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...Are you sure about this?"
msgstr ""

#. 悪いわね…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. それ…あまり見ないものね…
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "This is...something you don't see too often."
msgstr ""

#. 預かってもいい？
#. 少し調べてみたいの。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Do you mind if I keep it? I'd like to take a closer\n"
"look at it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少しは喜んでくれたかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean she liked it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. へぇ、面白い物ね…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well now, this is interesting."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと興味があるわ。
#. 貰っておこうかしら。
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I must admit, I'm intrigued. Can I hold on to it?"
msgstr ""

#. ふふふ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hmhmhm..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな物で喜ぶなんて、
#. なんだか自分がおかしいわ…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I actually feel...pleased. How strange..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>良かった。
#. どうやら喜んでくれたみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I get the impression that she liked it. That's good...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ありがとう。大切にするわね。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Thank you. This really means a lot to me."
msgstr ""

#. なんで知ってるの？
#. 私が、それを欲しがっていた事…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "How did you know I was interested in this?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、あなたって不思議な人ね…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You're an enigma, Makoto Naegi..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここまで喜んでもらえると、
#. あげたこっちも嬉しくなるよな…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing Kyoko so pleased with something I gave her\n"
"makes me happy!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あげる人を間違えているんじゃない？
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you sure you're giving this to the right person?"
msgstr ""

#. 私には不要な物ね。
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I have no need for this."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しまった…
#. がっかりさせちゃったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh-oh... I don't think she was too happy with that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いちいち言わなくちゃ駄目？
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do I even need to say it?"
msgstr ""

#. いらないわ…
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Obviously I don't need something like this."
msgstr ""

#. そんな物…よく持ってたわね…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Frankly, I'm surprised you would even have something\n"
"like this."
msgstr ""

#. わかってる？　褒めてるんじゃなくて、
#. 呆れているのよ？
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's not a compliment, by the way."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怒らせちゃったみたいだ…
#. 印象が悪くなっちゃったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...think I made her mad. She probably thinks worse of\n"
"me now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり渡す
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Maybe not..."
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼントを渡さなくてもよろしいですか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Are you sure you don't want to give her something?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
